  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the given figure the magnetic flux through the loop increases according to the relation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#981;</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>t</mi></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#981;</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></math> is in milliwebers and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math>&nbsp;is in seconds. The magnitude of current through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math> resistor at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> is _____&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mA</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0068_5718024b8a38.png\" style=\"width: 287px; height: 193px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "60",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mi>&#1013;</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mV</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>|</mo><mi>&#1013;</mi><mo>|</mo></mrow><mi>R</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mA</mi></math></p><p>At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mA</mi></math></p>"
